**Component:** `include/strata/core/device.hpp` — `DeviceArena::alloc()`

**Responsibilities:** Bump-allocates sub-regions from a single `cudaMalloc` block. Every session buffer

# Strata Engine — Repository Maintenance Plan

Below are 40 numbered maintenance items. Each identifies a distinct component from the supplied excerpts, explains its responsibilities, proposes a concrete change with a unified diff, and lists at least two verification cases.

